## Notes

- Round 2 changes: `onZoneItemPointerEnd` gates the dock decision on `zoneHidden` (A1);
  `syncZoneGeometry` re-orients and re-fits an existing grouped zone on every resize/locale reflow
  and `placeGroupedZone` keeps it below the toolbar (A3 + minor d); mobile zoom capture scrolls the
  pill into view (minor a); `ZONE_SETTLE_TIMEOUT` removed (minor b); README wording and this log
  corrected (minors c/e).
- `reviews/P0-29.md` contains the reviewer's round-1 fail verdict and is committed for the re-review;
  the re-review will append round 2.
- `.changes/P0-29-zone-collapse.md` was rewritten during the rework (same content, new mtime), so its
